            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Opportunity.IsClosed</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Opportunity_Closed</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Closed</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Synced_With_This_Quote</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Opportunity.SyncedQuoteId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Confirm_Resync</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Synced With This Quote</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Synced_With_Other_Quote</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Opportunity.SyncedQuoteId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Synced_Quote</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Synced With Other Quote</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>A large quote is synced by a background job, and the action returns the job&apos;s tracker Id; a standard quote is already copied, and no tracker Id comes back.</description>
        <name>Is_Background_Sync</name>
        <label>Is Background Sync</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Sync_Done</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Copied</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Tracker_Returned</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Sync_Quote_To_Opportunity.aotId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsBlank</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Sync_Queued</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Queued</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>The action returns isSuccess = false, without faulting, when validation fails or the background job can&apos;t be queued.</description>
        <name>Was_Sync_Accepted</name>
        <label>Was Sync Accepted</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Roll_Back_Rejected_Sync</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Rejected</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Sync_Accepted</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Sync_Quote_To_Opportunity.isSuccess</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Is_Background_Sync</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Accepted</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Quick action on the quote that syncs its lines to its opportunity&apos;s products, so the opportunity can be forecast from the quote. With Asynchronous Opportunity Sync on, which post_utils turns on for RLM_SyncRenewalQuoteOnOrderActivation, the platform hides the standard Start Sync button, and this action replaces it. An opportunity that syncs with no quote, or with another quote after the user confirms, is set to sync with this quote and given its price book, as the order-activation flow does; then the standard Sync Quote to Opportunity action copies the lines. A fault or rejected sync rolls back the synced-quote change. A synced quote that changes afterwards must be synced again before Create Order accepts it. As with any successful sync, RLM_CloseRenewalOpportunityOnQuoteSync closes the opportunity as Closed Won when the quote&apos;s orders are all activated.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>RLM Sync Quote to Opportunity {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>RLM Sync Quote to Opportunity</label>
